  "probe": "r-def-expr-sql/str-stored-length-and-codes",
  "bookRefs": [
    "R-STRING-1",
    "II-02",
    "R-EXPR-1",
    "EXPR-INVENTORY"
  ],
  "description": "Asks what SQL reports for the stored edge strings of Tx (38 rows in the Text(255) column T and the Memo column M: embedded and leading and trailing U+0000, odd-byte BSTRs of 1 and 3 bytes, lone high and low surrogates in both orders, an astral pair, a leading U+FEFF, U+FFFE, trailing space, no-break and zero-width spaces, a soft hyphen, compatibility forms, an empty string and Null): Len, LenB, Asc, AscW and AscB (rows with Len(T) > 0 only), VarType, TypeName and IsNull, Left, Right and Mid and their Len, and the plain T and M values (exact BSTR bytes). Each form is one snapshot ordered by ID, followed by DBEngine.Errors. Fixture r-def-expr-sql-main is opened read-only through DAO.DBEngine.120; engine version and the loaded modules (once) are recorded; each recordset reads Name, Type and Value of every field.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
